Package: BadWire
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, iproute2, pkexec
Maintainer: pb.mrak@yandex.ru
Description: Network emulation tool for debugging
 BadWire provides an easy-to-use GUI for tc-netem,
 allowing you to simulate network conditions like delay,
 packet loss, jitter, and more.
